cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If Prumo contributes to your work, cite the software and the exact release or
  commit used, so the price catalogue and cost model behind any number you
  report can be reconstructed. The catalogue data is licensed separately under
  CC BY 4.0 — see LICENSE-DATA for how to attribute it.
title: Prumo
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
authors:
  - name: Prumo contributors
abstract: >-
  An open-source, self-hosted platform for generating images through the user's
  own provider API keys: one prompt fanned out across several models at once,
  the cost of each image on screen before it is spent, a spending ceiling
  enforced by the database, and a sourced, dated price index across thirteen
  providers so the cheapest route can be chosen instead of guessed. This release
  identifies a pre-release repository: the architecture, database schema and
  provider survey are written, and no product feature is implemented yet.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Navesz/prumo
url: https://navesz.github.io/prumo/
keywords:
  - ai image generation
  - api cost
  - byok
  - model routing
  - price index
  - self-hosted
